  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Journals</p>
    <h1>Electronic Journal Archive</h1>
    <p class="lede">Daily journals are kept by date and removed once they are older than the retention window.</p>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="section">
  <h2>What happens</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Each journal is filed under the date in its name.</li>
    <li>Journals older than the retention window are removed.</li>
    <li>A record is kept of every journal filed and every journal removed.</li>
  </ol>
</section>
